{
  "id": "u04",
  "n": 4,
  "level": "A1",
  "title": "Key irregular verbs",
  "summary": "tener, ir, hacer, poder, querer, decir, venir and stem changes.",
  "explain": [
    {"h": "Stem-changing verbs"},
    {"p": "In many verbs the vowel in the stem changes when it is stressed: in **all forms except nosotros and vosotros**. The endings stay regular."},
    {"table": [["", "e → ie", "o → ue", "e → i"], ["", "querer", "poder", "pedir"], ["yo", "quiero", "puedo", "pido"], ["tú", "quieres", "puedes", "pides"], ["él / ella", "quiere", "puede", "pide"], ["nosotros", "queremos", "podemos", "pedimos"], ["vosotros", "queréis", "podéis", "pedís"], ["ellos", "quieren", "pueden", "piden"]], "head": true},
    {"p": "More: **e→ie** pensar, empezar, entender, cerrar, preferir · **o→ue** volver, encontrar, costar, dormir · **e→i** seguir, repetir, medir · **u→ue** jugar."},
    {"h": "Irregular \"yo\""},
    {"p": "Some verbs are irregular only in the yo form: **hago** (hacer), **pongo** (poner), **salgo** (salir), **traigo** (traer), **sé** (saber), **conozco** (conocer), **veo** (ver), **doy** (dar)."},
    {"h": "Both at once"},
    {"table": [["", "tener", "venir", "decir"], ["yo", "tengo", "vengo", "digo"], ["tú", "tienes", "vienes", "dices"], ["él / ella", "tiene", "viene", "dice"], ["nosotros", "tenemos", "venimos", "decimos"], ["vosotros", "tenéis", "venís", "decís"], ["ellos", "tienen", "vienen", "dicen"]], "head": true},
    {"h": "Completely irregular: ir"},
    {"p": "**voy, vas, va, vamos, vais, van.** *Voy a la obra.* = I'm going to the site."},
    {"tip": "*Construir* (to build) adds a y: construyo, construyes, construye, construimos, construís, construyen."}
  ],
  "exercises": [
